sky130hd flat (base)         1:01:09  2.77 GB   OK   abc 2,899 s, extract_fa 283 s
nangate45 hier               0:21:43  2.35 GB   OK   abc 705 s, extract_fa 247 s
sky130hd hier                0:21:20  2.35 GB   OK   abc 675 s, extract_fa 249 s
All four with ORFS's default SYNTH_MEMORY_MAX_BITS=4096 (no override).
Yosys read_slang of the whole SoC with each define
(soc-sram-synth-slang-memguard-2026-10-16.log): 15 macro instances per
platform, 22 inferred memories, largest 2048 bits (32x64 regfiles,
SHA-256 w). (That log's mem_dump.py line counts 0 bits because it reads
a flattened JSON; the per-cell scan above it is the inventory.)

